+; Minecraft's mobs each have an invisible Skyrim actor (a stand-in) where they stand: it is what you lock on to, what Skyrim's
+; spells hit, and what Skyrim's NPCs fight. How it is kept out of sight:
+;   geometry  its body isn't drawn, but the actor is left showing, so lock-on mods still see it (default)
